    ["<Assistant_Title1>Marionette Cultivation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\n1. Duplicate marionettes obtained will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Fragments</>; the number of fragments converted depends on the marionette's quality. Fragments can be used for <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Cultivation</>. \n2. Increasing the cultivation level of a marionette will increase the marionette's <Assistant_Property1>attribute bonuses</>. \n3. When the cultivation level reaches a certain stage, the marionette's skills will also <Assistant_Property1>Ascend</>, gaining <Assistant_Red>additional skill effects</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[获取秘偶]|536}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Marionette Cultivation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\n1. Duplicate marionettes obtained will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Fragments</>; the number of fragments converted depends on the marionette's quality. Fragments can be used for <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Cultivation</>. \n2. Increasing the cultivation level of a marionette will increase the marionette's <Assistant_Property1>attribute bonuses</>. \n3. When the cultivation level reaches a certain stage, the marionette's skills will also <Assistant_Property1>Ascend</>, gaining <Assistant_Red>additional skill effects</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Obtain Marionette]|536}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵体之线】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>碰触万物相连的灵体之线，就能与其建立连接，接管其意识，使其成为你的秘偶，被你控制的单位将听从你的指令。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找灵体之线</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【灵体之线】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【灵体之线】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 操控秘偶</>\n到达目标区域后，使用<Assistant_Red>【附身】</>技能控制指定单位，并运用秘偶的能力完成对应挑战。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 完成挑战</>\n成功完成挑战后，即可开启宝箱并领取奖励\n<Assistant_Title1>【助手提示】</>\n开启【附身】后，可以附身的单位上方往往出现<Assistant_Red>【可附身】</>标签提示，注意观察四周~"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【spirit body threads】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>By touching the spirit body threads that connect all things, you can establish a connection with them, take over their consciousness, and make them your marionette. Units controlled by you will obey your commands.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding spirit body threads</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [spirit body threads] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [spirit body threads] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Controlling a Marionette</>\nAfter arriving at the target area, use the <Assistant_Red>[Possession]</> skill to control the designated unit and use the marionette's abilities to complete the corresponding challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Completing the Challenge</>\nAfter successfully completing the challenge, you can open the treasure chest and claim your reward.\n<Assistant_Title1>【Assistant Tip】</>\nAfter activating [Possession], a <Assistant_Red>[Possessable]</> tag will often appear above units that can be possessed; keep an eye on your surroundings~",
